  be  the sullying of the true reparations  that the united states owes to us it is  however  a first step an attempt to try and  correct the wrongs of the past  by acknowledging the painful legacy that  still exists today  jackson prosko global news washington  and that is global national for this  sunday night i'm robin gill  tonight your canada is the bay of quinte  in belleville ontario  we want to see as many parts of this  country so please keep sending your  photos  to viewers at globalnational.com thank  you for watching donna friesen will be  back at the anchor desk tomorrow  and i'll see you next weekend have a  great week  you
 

